  "description": "Reid Explorer S | 12 inch kids' bike\nThe Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" is a fun, BMX-inspired kids' bike designed to help young riders build confidence and enjoy their first adventures on two wheels. With a durable steel frame and child-friendly components, it's built for everyday riding and plenty of fun.\nBMX-style handlebars provide a comfortable riding position and responsive steering, while the rear coaster brake makes stopping simple by pedalling backwards. This easy-to-use braking system helps young riders develop control as they learn to ride.\nA full-length chainguard helps protect little fingers and clothing from the chain, while the junior-specific saddle and grips provide a comfortable fit for smaller riders.\nWith its bold BMX-inspired styling and durable construction, the Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" is ready for trips to the park, family rides and everyday neighbourhood adventures.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Explorer for?\nThe Explorer 12\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\nYoung riders ready for their first pedal bike\nChildren developing confidence with pedalling and steering\nRiders who love BMX-inspired styling\nYoung cyclists learning to brake and control their bike\nParents looking for a durable, easy-to-use kids' bike\nEveryday adventures, from park trips to family rides\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
